---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="KPMG Practicum: SEC Financial Data Infrastructure | Michael Li"
  description="An ongoing Columbia QMSS practicum building SEC filing data infrastructure, with Michael Li responsible for database and integration work."
  sideBarActiveItemID="projects"
>
  <a href="/projects" class="link link-hover text-sm">Back to Projects</a>

  <article class="max-w-3xl mt-6">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 mb-2">Columbia QMSS / KPMG practicum · In progress</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">SEC Financial Data Infrastructure</h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Building a traceable data foundation for public SEC 10-K and 10-Q filings,
        intended to support downstream retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and GraphRAG research.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/michaelliruoxi/data_engineering_kpmg"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="btn btn-outline btn-sm"
      >View on GitHub</a>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="role-heading" class="border-t border-base-300 pt-6 mb-8">
      <h2 id="role-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">My role</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        I own database and integration work within a seven-person engineering team.
        My responsibilities include schema evolution, shared data imports, and coordinating
        interfaces between the team's processing modules.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="foundation-heading" class="border-t border-base-300 pt-6 mb-8">
      <h2 id="foundation-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Foundation in place</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        The public repository includes a PostgreSQL schema, versioned storage helpers,
        source metadata and citation views, and a metadata CLI. The shared database
        foundation is deployed on AWS RDS.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="sample-heading" class="border-t border-base-300 pt-6 mb-8">
      <h2 id="sample-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Current sample and next steps</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mb-3">
        A partial, manually prepared Microsoft 10-Q sample contains 24 financial facts,
        3 statement excerpts, 24 table-to-fact links, and 1 report excerpt with 2 sections
        and 6 text chunks. It gives the team concrete records to query and trace to public sources.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Full-filing processing, interface agreement, and teammate network onboarding remain
        in progress. The sample is not a completed automated pipeline or RAG product.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/michaelliruoxi/data_engineering_kpmg/blob/main/docs/manual-example.md"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="link link-hover"
      >Read the manual example</a>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="tools-heading" class="border-t border-base-300 pt-6">
      <h2 id="tools-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Tools</h2>
      <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">Python · SQL · PostgreSQL · AWS RDS · SEC EDGAR / XBRL</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
